{
  "label": "Flight Deck",
  "order": 2,
  "$description": "Carrier deck markings pushed forward in time: non-skid deck plates and cockpit type, with a single black-and-yellow hazard band on the Wall action and stencil kept for short titles. Deck-crew jersey colours give each metric family a role colour (green counts, yellow timing, purple rates, white technique, red fault notes), always beside a label.",
  "signature": "A wall tap fires a catapult-style split flash: in one flash interval the shuttle runs the track under the running split and a live streak lights behind it. Only the finish touch holds the live frame a little longer.",
  "colorScheme": "dark",
